# Worg Carrier from Kibler's Exotic Pets (Upper Blackrock Spire).
# Sources: quests.json (Kibler's quest); Upper Blackrock Spire
# (58-60) is in Forever; Forever client 1.60.1.70338. The reward is
# general Era knowledge (not in quests.json).

step Kibler at Flame Crest
  tip Kibler stands at Flame Crest in northern Burning Steppes, near the Blackrock Mountain path.
  accept 4729

step Upper Blackrock Spire
  tip Upper Blackrock Spire is a raid group of up to ten, level 58-60. Use Kibler's cage on a Bloodaxe Worg Pup (Halycon's den) to get the Caged Worg Pup.
  collect 12263 quest 4729 @33.2,24.9 -- Upper Blackrock Spire

step Back to Kibler
  turnin 4729
  collect 12264 @65.9,21.9            -- Worg Carrier
